      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u7",
      "unit_position": 7,
      "raw_text": "6、项目中用到了 ES，请你谈谈 ES 和 Lucene 的关系",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u8:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u8",
      "unit_position": 8,
      "raw_text": "7、ES 是怎么实现高效检索的？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u9:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u9",
      "unit_position": 9,
      "raw_text": "8、ES 的数据查询是放在内存中还是磁盘中？",
