    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u11:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u11",
      "unit_position": 11,
      "raw_text": "10、MySQL 中我如果执行一条 select 语句，limit 100,100; 那么实际在数据库中检索了多少行数据？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u12:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u12",
      "unit_position": 12,
      "raw_text": "11、处理 MySQL 深分页查询的手段有哪些？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u13:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b81a39000000001c034f47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u13",
      "unit_position": 13,
      "raw_text": "12、你觉得现在的大型商业产品是如何去处理深分页问题的？比如 Google 或者百度，怎么处理深分页的？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
